###### PAYMENT WEBHOOKS (XENDIT) ######
### Simulates Xendit invoice callbacks. No Bearer token — auth is via X-Callback-Token.
### Handler: POST /api/v1/payments/webhooks/xendit (payment-xendit module)
### The external_id must match an existing PENDING payment — copy the real value from the
### create payment response. status=PAID marks the payment as paid, applies the amount to the
### invoice, and is read live by the dashboard (sales.cash / sales.billing / topMenus).

### Webhook - PAID (marks payment as paid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhooks/xendit
X-Callback-Token: {{xenditCallbackToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "inv_6200-0001",
    "external_id": "INV-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx",
    "status": "PAID",
    "amount": 22000,
    "paid_amount": 22000,
    "payment_method": "QRIS",
    "payment_channel": "QRIS",
    "currency": "IDR",
    "description": "Testing xendit",
    "created": "2026-09-07T10:00:00.000Z",
    "updated": "2026-09-07T10:01:00.000Z",
    "merchant_name": "Rascal"
}

### Webhook - PENDING (no state change on payment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhooks/xendit
X-Callback-Token: {{xenditCallbackToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "external_id": "INV-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx",
    "status": "PENDING",
    "amount": 22000,
    "payment_method": "QRIS",
    "payment_channel": "QRIS",
    "currency": "IDR"
}

### Webhook - EXPIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhooks/xendit
X-Callback-Token: {{xenditCallbackToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "external_id": "INV-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx",
    "status": "EXPIRED",
    "amount": 22000,
    "payment_method": "QRIS",
    "payment_channel": "QRIS",
    "currency": "IDR"
}

### Webhook - REFUNDED (refund = fakta keluar tersendiri: cash.refunded + billing.refundedAmount; topMenus tetap bruto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhooks/xendit
X-Callback-Token: {{xenditCallbackToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "external_id": "INV-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx",
    "status": "REFUNDED",
    "amount": 22000,
    "payment_method": "QRIS",
    "payment_channel": "QRIS",
    "currency": "IDR"
}

### Webhook - unknown status (maps to FAILED on payment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhooks/xendit
X-Callback-Token: {{xenditCallbackToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "external_id": "INV-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx",
    "status": "WEIRD_STATUS",
    "amount": 22000,
    "currency": "IDR"
}

### Webhook - invalid callback token (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhooks/xendit
X-Callback-Token: wrong-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "external_id": "INV-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx",
    "status": "PAID",
    "amount": 22000,
    "currency": "IDR"
}

### Webhook - missing callback token (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhooks/xendit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "external_id": "INV-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx",
    "status": "PAID",
    "amount": 22000,
    "currency": "IDR"
}

### Webhook - malformed JSON (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhooks/xendit
X-Callback-Token: {{xenditCallbackToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "external_id": "INV-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx", "status": "PAID",, }
